---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Guestbook from '../components/Guestbook.jsx'; // <-- Tambahkan ini
---

<Layout title="Obedman | Fullstack Developer">
	<div class="lg:flex lg:justify-between lg:gap-4">
<!-- KIRI: Header / Bio statis -->
		<header class="lg:sticky lg:top-0 lg:flex lg:max-h-screen lg:w-1/2 lg:flex-col lg:justify-between lg:py-24">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
<!-- GAMBAR AVATAR MEMBAUR (Diperbesar ~30%) -->
				<img 
					src="/avatar.png" 
					alt="Obedman" 
					class="mb-6 w-44 h-44 md:w-52 md:h-52 rounded-2xl object-cover opacity-90 mix-blend-luminosity hover:mix-blend-normal transition-all duration-500"
					style="mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 60%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 60%, transparent 100%);"
				/>

				<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-200 sm:text-5xl">
					<a href="/">Obedman</a>
				</h1>
				<h2 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">
					Fullstack Software Engineer
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-xs mx-auto leading-normal text-slate-400">
					Membangun antarmuka web modern dengan backend performa tinggi yang solid.
				</p>
			</div>
		</header>
		<!-- KANAN: Konten yang bisa di-scroll -->
		<main id="content" class="pt-24 lg:w-1/2 lg:py-24">
			
			<!-- SECTION: ABOUT -->
			<section id="about" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-200 lg:hidden mb-4">About</h3>
				<p class="mb-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Saya adalah seorang software engineer yang fokus membangun ekosistem digital dari hulu ke hilir. Berbekal pengalaman dengan <strong class="text-teal-300 font-medium">Node.js, Go, dan PHP Laravel</strong>, saya membangun arsitektur backend yang tahan banting dan efisien. 
				</p>
				<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Untuk antarmuka, saya meracik UI/UX modern dan responsif dengan <strong class="text-teal-300 font-medium">TypeScript dan Tailwind CSS</strong>, didukung oleh fondasi database menggunakan <strong class="text-teal-300 font-medium">PostgreSQL dan MySQL</strong>. Fokus utama saya adalah memberikan <i>performance</i> maksimal tanpa mengorbankan estetika.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- SECTION: PROJECTS -->
			<section id="projects" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-200 lg:hidden mb-4">Projects</h3>
				
				<!-- List Project (Gunakan group/list untuk efek fokus) -->
				<ul class="group/list">
					
					<!-- Project 1 -->
					<li class="mb-12 transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-50">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 md:gap-4 lg:hover:!opacity-100 lg:hover:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-md p-4 lg:-m-4">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2024</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h3 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200">
									<a class="inline-flex items-baseline font-medium leading-tight text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="#" target="_blank">
										<span>High-Performance Backend API <span class="inline-block transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1">↗</span></span>
									</a>
								</h3>
								<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-normal text-slate-400">
									Membangun REST API berkinerja tinggi menggunakan Golang dan PostgreSQL yang diekspos secara aman ke internet via Cloudflare Tunnels.
								</p>
								<ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap" aria-label="Technologies used">
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">Go</div></li>
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">PostgreSQL</div></li>
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">Ubuntu Server</div></li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

					<!-- Project 2 -->
					<li class="mb-12 transition-all hover:!opacity-100 group-hover/list:opacity-50">
						<div class="group relative grid pb-1 transition-all sm:grid-cols-8 sm:gap-8 md:gap-4 lg:hover:!opacity-100 lg:hover:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-md p-4 lg:-m-4">
							<header class="z-10 mb-2 mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500 sm:col-span-2">2023</header>
							<div class="z-10 sm:col-span-6">
								<h3 class="font-medium leading-snug text-slate-200">
									<a class="inline-flex items-baseline font-medium leading-tight text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="#" target="_blank">
										<span>Fullstack Web Management <span class="inline-block transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1">↗</span></span>
									</a>
								</h3>
								<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-normal text-slate-400">
									Mengembangkan dashboard manajemen komprehensif menggunakan ekosistem Laravel dan Node.js dengan antarmuka yang bersih dan interaktif.
								</p>
								<ul class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap" aria-label="Technologies used">
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">Laravel</div></li>
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">Node.js</div></li>
									<li class="mr-1.5 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium leading-5 text-teal-300">Tailwind CSS</div></li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</li>

				</ul>
			</section>
			<!-- SECTION: GUESTBOOK -->
			<section id="guestbook" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24">
				<h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-200 lg:hidden mb-4">Buku Tamu</h3>
				<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
					Tinggalkan pesan di sini.
				</p>
				
				<!-- client:load sangat penting agar interaktivitas React berjalan di Astro -->
				<Guestbook client:load />
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>